# Editing an entry in the Today view: Tab and Shift+Tab do nothing there, Enter only ends editing, and the text change lands in the right project.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write quarterly report @due({today-2})
	- Review pull requests
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-7})
END
keys gt
see ▌ - Renew passport  INBOX
keys j <Enter>
type  draft
keys <Tab> <S-Tab> <Enter>
see ▌ - Write quarterly report draft  Work
status NAVIGATE
keys j *
keys g*
see Starred
see ▌ - Pay rent 󰓎  Home
keys gh
see Home: 
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write quarterly report draft @due({today-2})
	- Review pull requests
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-7}) @star
END
